Package: lsa-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Linux Security Auditor
Depends: systemd, ca-certificates
Recommends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv
Description: Linux Security Auditor unified agent
 Outbound-only, audit-only Linux security agent for the LSA platform.
 It enrolls with a one-time token, retrieves group policy, runs the bundled
 scanner, signs evidence locally, and uploads reports over HTTPS.
